    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly present this exceptional and generously proportioned two-bedroom apartment extending to c.88 sq. m., superbly located in the heart of Grand Canal Dock at Hanover Court, a recently completed development of only 40 apartments adjacent to Capital Dock. Stylish and presented in turn-key condition, special features include an A3 BER rating, high-spec Neff kitchen with quartz countertops and utility, high ceilings, ample storage, attractive bathrooms with polished porcelain tiling, energy-efficient underfloor heating, one designated parking space and access to a fantastic resident roof garden.\r\n\r\nThe bright and well proportioned interior comprises of a generous entrance hall with two storage rooms, an open plan living/kitchen/dining room with access to a spacious terrace, utility room, two bedrooms with main en-suite and a bathroom.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended!\r\n\r\nMore about the location...\r\n\r\nGrand Canal Dock is a vibrant urban quarter with a variety of neighbourhood bars, bistros, cafes and restaurants clustered around the historic city dock where the iconic Grand Canal Theatre and the Marker Hotel face onto the scenic, Martha Schwartz designed waterfront plaza. St Stephen's Green, Ballsbridge, the IFSC and Sandymount are all within 15 minutes' walking distance while the DART at Grand Canal provides easy access to the city centre and beyond. Dublin airport is only a twenty minute drive."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hallway (3.74m x 1.50m) MAX\r\nInviting L-shaped entrance hallway with engineered timber flooring and access to the storage room.\r\n\r\nLiving/dining/kitchen (7.66m x 6.51m)\r\nElegant, open plan area filled with natural daylight, high ceilings, engineered timber flooring and access to the patio.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is a custom designed, high gloss by Nolan Kitchens with Neff appliances including oven, hob, extractor hood, fridge freezer and dishwasher. Quartz countertops and tiled with glazed porcelain tiles.\r\n\r\nUtility (2.15m x 1.01m)\r\nUtility room with washer/dryer.\r\n\r\nMain bedroom (7.12m x 2.81m) MAX\r\nLarge double bedroom with high ceilings, built-in wardrobe and engineered timber flooring.\r\n\r\nEn-suite (2.31m x 1.677m)\r\nAttractive en suite with Vetra WC, WHB and rain walk-in shower. It has extensive wall and floor tiling, and attractive mirrored vanity units with quartz countertops.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (4.93m x 2.69m) MAX\r\nSpacious double bedroom with high ceilings, built-in wardrobes and engineered timber flooring.\r\n\r\nBathroom (2.69m x 1.62m)\r\nAttractive bathroom to include Vetra WC, WHB and a double walk-in shower. It has extensive wall and floor tiling, thermostatically controlled shower, and attractive mirrored vanity units with quartz countertops.\r\n\r\nStorage (2.81m x 1.49m)\r\n\r\nALL MEASUREMENTS ARE APPROXIMATE AND FOR GUIDANCE ONLY"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Extra spacious two bedroom apartment.\r\nA3 BER rating.\r\nHigh ceilings.\r\nFully fitted kitchen with Neff appliances, quartz countertops and island.\r\nDesignated underground car parking space.\r\nEnergy efficient underfloor heating. Room by room Heatmiser thermostats.\r\nLandscaped rooftop terrace with breath-taking views of Dublin bay.\r\nTriple glazed windows.\r\nGenerous storage space.\r\nStylish bathrooms with polished porcelain tiles and quartz countertops.\r\nPrime location in the heart of Grand Canal Dock."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A3"
      }
